    "section_faq": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_106": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "narrow",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_107": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "t:names.accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_088": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will the compressed bag fit in my carry-on?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_089": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Each bag measures 18.5″ × 11.8″ × 5.9″ and compresses down to roughly 3″ thick, sized for standard carry-ons and backpacks. Your suitcase still needs to meet your airline's size rules; Voltairs just makes sure everything fits inside it.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_089"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_090": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is it guaranteed to shrink my clothes by 60%?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_091": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Honestly, no. Up to 60% is the maximum we measured, and the result depends on the fabric. Fluffy items that trap air, like sweaters, hoodies, and jackets, compress the most. Dense fabrics like denim compress less. Most mixed loads still shrink far beyond what rolling or packing cubes can do.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_091"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_092": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does the pump need batteries?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_093": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. The 30W pump is USB-C rechargeable, has a long-lasting battery, and doubles as an LED light. It deflates a full bag in seconds, and with the included nozzles it inflates air mattresses and pool floats too.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_093"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_094": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will my clothes come out wrinkled?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_095": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Compression presses clothes flat rather than crumpling them, so jeans, knits, and casual wear come out fine. Fold delicate shirts on top of the stack and give them a quick shake-out when you arrive.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_095"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_096": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How much actually fits in one bag?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_097": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Up to 22 lb of clothing per bag, roughly 8 to 10 days of outfits once compressed to about 40% of their original size. The kit includes two bags.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_097"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_098": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What's new in this updated kit?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_099": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>This is version 2 of the Voltairs kit, rebuilt around feedback from our first version, with a focus on the seal, the zipper, and the pump. If you own V1 and wonder whether to upgrade, email us at info@voltairs.com and we will give you an honest answer.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_099"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_100": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_101": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Every kit comes with a 100-day money-back guarantee. If it does not save you space and money, return it for a full refund. No questions asked.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_101"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_102": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How much does shipping cost?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_103": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Nothing. Every Voltairs kit ships free within the United States.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
